{"2050710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Narin: The Orange Room", "steam_appid": 2050710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>OUT NOW</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/fad8a423a62e4060302b1a39affc00e8.avif?t=1775923935\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/cbdecc9042781d7bdf504cc7467a6436.poster.avif?t=1775923935\" width=560 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/cbdecc9042781d7bdf504cc7467a6436.webm?t=1775923935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narin: The Orange Room is a third-person adventure horror game. Play as Narin, a young girl whose sister mysteriously disappeared. According to rumors circulating among students in the school, those who haven't left before twilight mysteriously vanish...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/fbd463709fbd2d782a96a272ce3dbb06.poster.avif?t=1775923935\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/fbd463709fbd2d782a96a272ce3dbb06.webm?t=1775923935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/fbd463709fbd2d782a96a272ce3dbb06.mp4?t=1775923935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narin accidentally teleports into a strange twilight dimension she never intended to enter. But she knows her sister might be there, so she chooses to stay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/835f864b64e2479f7413f4c9e435c6fd.poster.avif?t=1775923935\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/835f864b64e2479f7413f4c9e435c6fd.webm?t=1775923935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/835f864b64e2479f7413f4c9e435c6fd.mp4?t=1775923935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only lamplight and a mysterious cat to guide her, Narin must delve deeper into the dark to find the truth about her sister. Strange characters come and go, leaving advice that may help, hinder, or harm her on her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/f7529724ba7fb5c5beffdbd8f6b6862c.poster.avif?t=1775923935\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/f7529724ba7fb5c5beffdbd8f6b6862c.webm?t=1775923935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/f7529724ba7fb5c5beffdbd8f6b6862c.mp4?t=1775923935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Narin survive as she pieces together clues, solves puzzles, and uncovers the secret origin of this strange alternative reality. It's the only way to find her sister. She has to push through to the end...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/63fc5ec34d3d3f800addfb02c615ac16.poster.avif?t=1775923935\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/63fc5ec34d3d3f800addfb02c615ac16.webm?t=1775923935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/63fc5ec34d3d3f800addfb02c615ac16.mp4?t=1775923935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/cbdecc9042781d7bdf504cc7467a6436.poster.avif?t=1775923935\" width=560 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/cbdecc9042781d7bdf504cc7467a6436.webm?t=1775923935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narin: The Orange Room is a third-person adventure horror game. Play as Narin, a young girl whose sister mysteriously disappeared. According to rumors circulating among students in the school, those who haven't left before twilight mysteriously vanish...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/fbd463709fbd2d782a96a272ce3dbb06.poster.avif?t=1775923935\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2050710/extras/fbd463709fbd2d782a96a272ce3dbb06.webm?t=1775923935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source sr